{"t":"Dark Armor Quest","s":"dark-armor-quest-d90c7","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Dark_Armor_Quest_Map_01_de7abb.jpg","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Dark Armor Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Edron GS Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(40+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.4<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 2, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>A warrior has been killed by a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a> deep in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Orc%20Cave\">Edron Orc Cave</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Orc%20Cave\">Edron Orc Cave</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, Orc Spearmen, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Shaman\">Orc Shamans</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Leader\">Orc Leaders</a>, and one <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Armor\">Dark Armor</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p><b>Note:</b> At the level range of 8~40, this cave has some difficult creatures, and the rewards are not terribly exciting. It is recommended to get a team together and complete all of the quests in this cave at one time, instead of making multiple trips.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Go down into the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Orc%20Cave\">Edron Orc Cave</a>. The entrance is southwest of the castle (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33173,31900,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33173, 31900, 7)</a>). You can access this area through a drain in the basement of the Edron Flats.</li>\n<li>Once in the hole, you will meet only <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, Orc Spearmen and <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a>. Follow the cave to the west and then south. There are a couple of side rooms, but basically there is only one way to go.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dark Armor Quest Map 01\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"255\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dark_Armor_Quest_Map_01_de7abb.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>On the next level, you will face <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc\">Orcs</a>, Orc Spearmen, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Warrior\">Orc Warriors</a> and probably one or two lured <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>. Go west and take the passage north. Go into the first room on the east and drop down the hole.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dark Armor Quest Map 02\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dark_Armor_Quest_Map_02_98ea44.jpg\" width=\"280\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>As soon as you drop down this hole, you will be surrounded by <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Shaman\">Orc Shamans</a>. Remember, energy attacks do not work on <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Shaman\">shamans</a>, so use <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">GFBs</a> to clear the room (the summoned snakes make it hard to aim, and your knights can't get through them to attack the Shamans).</li>\n<li>On this level, go north, facing more <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Shaman\">Orc Shamans</a> and one or two <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>. You will walk over a tile-floor area - this means you are on the right track.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dark Armor Quest Map 03\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"245\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dark_Armor_Quest_Map_03_312b11.jpg\" width=\"160\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>When you go to the next level, you will face <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Spider\">Poison Spiders</a>, multiple <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Leader\">Orc Leaders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Shaman\">Orc Shamans</a> and probably one or two lured <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Berserker\">Orc Berserkers</a>. Head north and you will see a large pit and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a> waiting for you inside of it. The hole to get down is on the north-east side of the pit.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dark Armor Quest Map 04\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"174\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dark_Armor_Quest_Map_04_5ca78a.jpg\" width=\"208\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Just go down the hole and kill the <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spider</a>. You can find the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Armor\">Dark Armor</a> inside a dead body on the ground. Instead of killing the Giant Spider you can also put on <a href=\"#/wiki/Defensive%20Fighting\">Defensive Fighting</a> mode, run to the body, grab the loot, and go back.</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["against-the-spider-cult-quest","berserker-treasure-quest","poison-daggers-quest"]}